## External Integrations

Include this section only if the project talks to external APIs, databases, queues, or third-party services. For each integration, document: what it is, why it is needed, the failure mode if it is unavailable, and how the project isolates it (client wrapper, gateway, anti-corruption layer). If there are no external integrations, omit this section rather than leaving it empty.

## Observability

